{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"RED phase confirmed. The test is FAIL:\n1. `.rick/domain/spec.md does not exist`\n2. `.rick/domain/README.md index missing spec.md line`\n\nNow I understand the full picture. Let me also check the ctrl_prompt.md to see if there are additional instructions about how to do the task (it may contain the domain knowledge about the refactor conclusions, env four responsibilities, etc.). The task mentions \"spec 规范须能承载本次重构的收敛结论：rick = 引导程序（env 保证 pi 就绪 → builder 拼提示词 → runtime 拉 pi），env 四职责、runtime 职责（拉起 pi + 内部校验 session 就绪 + 返回 (sessionID, trace)）、handler 职责（编排 + 持久化 sessionID）、下沉策略...\"\n\nThese are in the task goal already. Let me read the ctrl_prompt to see if there's more detail, but it might be a generic ctrl prompt. Let me check it briefly.\n\nActually, I already have all the info I need from the RFC and task goal. The RFC §4 defines:\n- 路由层 cli\n- 处理层 handler\n- 执行层 env + builder + runtime\n\nenv: 环境配置、关键依赖检查/下载/安装/配置；pi 及扩展维护更新\nbuilder: 拼接提示词\nruntime: pi/dsh 调用封装\n\nBut the task mentions \"env 四职责\" and \"runtime 职责（拉起 pi + 内部校验 session 就绪 + 返回 (sessionID, trace)）\" and \"handler 职责（编排 + 持久化 sessionID）\". These come from the broader planning context (task2 will produce the first spec with env four responsibilities contract). But for task1, I need the spec规范 (the规范 template), not the actual rick spec (that's task2).\n\nWait, let me re-read the task goal carefully:\n\n\"产出 spec 规范文档：定义 spec 的结构模板（四要素：模块边界 / 职责 / 接口契约 / 验收标准）、spec 与 domain 其他文档的关系，以及 spec 的验收标准定义（spec → 开发计划 → 功能等价实现；功能等价 = 通过所有功能验收，即「丢弃源码即可 AI coding 出功能等价的 rick」）。\n\nspec 规范须能承载本次重构的收敛结论：rick = 引导程序（env 保证 pi 就绪 → builder 拼提示词 → runtime 拉 pi），env 四职责、runtime 职责（拉起 pi + 内部校验 session 就绪 + 返回 (sessionID, trace)）、handler 职责（编排 + 持久化 sessionID）、下沉策略（dag 调度 → pi workflowScript 编排；门禁 → pi hook/脚本；think/research/exporter → pi agent）。\"\n\nSo task1 produces the spec规范文档 (spec.md), which:\n1. Defines what spec is\n2. Four-element template (模块边界/职责/接口契约/验收标准)\n3. Relationship with other domain docs\n4. Acceptance criteria definition (spec → dev plan → functionally equivalent impl; functional equivalence = pass all functional acceptance)\n5. Actionable criteria for \"discard source code → AI reconstruct functionally equivalent rick\" (which commands dry-run/check/integration tests must pass)\n6. Must \"承载\" (carry/embody) the refactor conclusions: rick = bootstrap, env four responsibilities, runtime responsibilities, handler responsibilities, sinking strategy\n\nThe \"承载\" part means the spec.md规范 should be able to承载 these conclusions — i.e., the规范 should be able to express/carry these. But it could also mean the spec.md should reference these conclusions as examples. Since task2 will produce the actual rick spec (the first spec), task1's spec.md is the规范 (the template + acceptance criteria). But it must be able to承载 the convergence conclusions.\n\nI think the best approach: write spec.md as the规范 document, and within it, use the refactor convergence conclusions as the concrete example/placeholder for the four-element template (i.e., the placeholder example should demonstrate how to fill in the four elements using the rick three-layer architecture refactor). This \"承载\"s the conclusions.\n\nLet me think about the structure of spec.md:\n\n# Spec 规范 — 结构化自然语言工程实现契约\n\n## 1. 什么是 spec\n- spec = 结构化自然语言描述的工程实现契约\n- 是 rick 的信息内核\n- 方法/实现隔离：rick = 方法（自然语言），pi = 实现（编程语言）\n- 目标：丢弃一切源码，即可完全 AI coding 出一个功能等价的 rick\n\n## 2. spec 四要素结构模板\n四个要素，各附说明与占位示例：\n- 模块边界\n- 职责\n- 接口契约\n- 验收标准\n\nEach with a description and a placeholder example (using the rick refactor conclusions).\n\n## 3. spec 与 domain 其他文档的关系\n- domain/architecture.md, commands.md, go-patterns.md, testing-conventions.md, project-conventions.md, env.md, pi-runtime.md, bugs.md\n- spec.md 与其他文档的关系\n\n## 4. spec 的验收标准\n- spec → 开发计划 → 功能等价实现\n- 功能等价 = 通过所有功能验收\n- 「丢弃源码 → AI 重构出功能等价 rick」的可操作判据（列出哪些命令 dry-run/check/集成测试必须通过）\n\n## 5. 本次重构收敛结论（承载）\n- rick = 引导程序（env 保证 pi 就绪 → builder 拼提示词 → runtime 拉 pi）\n- env 四职责\n- runtime 职责（拉起 pi + 内部校验 session 就绪 + 返回 (sessionID, trace)）\n- handler 职责（编排 + 持久化 sessionID）\n- 下沉策略（dag 调度 → pi workflowScript 编排；门禁 → pi hook/脚本；think/research/exporter → pi agent）\n\nNow, the test requirements:\n1. `spec.md` exists ✓\n2. README.md contains `spec.md` ✓\n3. spec.md contains `模块边界`, `职责`, `接口契约`, `验收标准` (each individually) ✓\n4. spec.md contains `功能等价` (≥1) ✓\n5. spec.md contains `{{` (=0) — no template variable leaks ✓ (be careful not to write `{{` anywhere)\n6. spec.md contains `dry-run` OR `go test` OR `集成测试` (≥1) ✓\n\nI need to be careful about the `{{` check. I should not use `{{...}}` anywhere. If I want to show a placeholder, I should use something like `<模块名>` or `【模块名】` instead of `{{模块名}}`.\n\nAlso need to check: the env四职责 and other specifics. Let me look for more info about \"env 四职责\". The task2 (next task) is \"产出 rick 第一份 spec（四层架构 + 5 模块 + env 四职责契约）\". The tasks.json task2 mentions \"四层架构 + 5 模块 + env 四职责契约\". So env四职责 is defined somewhere. Let me check the ctrl_prompt.md or the draft for details on env四职责.\n\nActually, the task goal for task1 says \"env 四职责\" but doesn't enumerate them. Let me check if there's a planning doc (task*.md or plan) that enumerates env four responsibilities. The plan phase would have created taskN.md files. Let me check .rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tasks/ directory.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_cADCsyXEYk9Efj0mxYeb5918","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && find .rick/jobs/job_35 -type f | sort; echo \"---PLAN DIR---\"; find .rick/jobs/job_35 -name \"*.md\" -path \"*task*\" 2>/dev/null; find .rick/jobs -maxdepth 3 -name \"task*.md\" 2>/dev/null | grep job_35"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":159,"output":1777,"cacheRead":38400,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1641,"totalTokens":4033