{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Now I have all the information I need. Let me determine the actionable criteria (可操作判据) for \"丢弃源码 → AI 重构出功能等价 rick\":\n\nFrom the domain docs:\n- `go test ./...` — 单元测试 (though testing-conventions warns against full run for internal, the \"等价\" criteria for full reconstruction would be `go test ./...`)\n- `bash tests/tools_integration_test.sh` — 集成测试\n- `./bin/rick <cmd> --dry-run` — dry-run 输出正确 (doing/plan/learning/easy/dream/ctrl/human-loop), no `{{` leak\n- `./bin/rick tools <check>` — plan_check/doing_check/learning_check/dream_check\n\nNow let me write the spec.md. I need to be careful:\n1. Contains 模块边界, 职责, 接口契约, 验收标准 (each)\n2. Contains 功能等价 (≥1)\n3. NO `{{` (0)\n4. Contains dry-run OR go test OR 集成测试 (≥1) — I'll include all three\n5. Uses the refactor conclusions as the placeholder example (承载)\n\nLet me design the spec.md structure. It should be a规范 (specification of the spec concept), i.e., the meta-spec. The structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Spec 规范 — rick 的工程实现契约\n\n> 本文档定义「spec」这一 domain 描述方法升级的核心概念（RFC §5「信息内核 = spec」、§6 O1 KR1.1/KR1.3）。\n> spec = 结构化自然语言描述的工程实现契约，是 rick 的信息内核。\n\n## 1. spec 是什么\n\n- spec 是结构化自然语言描述的**工程实现契约**：用无歧义的自然语言，把一个软件「是什么、做什么、怎么交互、怎样算对」写清楚。\n- spec 是 rick 的**信息内核**：方法（自然语言）与实现（编程语言）隔离；只要 spec 无歧义地描述了验收标准，丢弃一切源码，也能被 AI 转化为功能等价的开发计划，进而重构出功能等价的 rick。\n- 目标：丢弃一切源码，即可完全 AI coding 出一个功能等价的 rick。\n\n## 2. spec 四要素结构模板\n\n每份 spec 必须覆盖以下四个要素（缺一不可）：\n\n### 2.1 模块边界\n说明 + 占位示例\n\n### 2.2 职责\n说明 + 占位示例\n\n### 2.3 接口契约\n说明 + 占位示例\n\n### 2.4 验收标准\n说明 + 占位示例\n\n## 3. spec 与 domain 其他文档的关系\n- 表格列出 domain 各文档与 spec 的关系\n\n## 4. spec 的验收标准（spec → 开发计划 → 功能等价实现）\n- 功能等价 = 通过所有功能验收\n- 可操作判据（丢弃源码 → AI 重构功能等价 rick）\n  - dry-run / go test / 集成测试 清单\n\n## 5. 本次重构收敛结论的承载（示例）\n- rick = 引导程序\n- env 四职责\n- runtime 职责\n- handler 职责\n- 下沉策略\n```\n\nNow let me think about the placeholder examples using the refactor conclusions. For each element, the placeholder example should demonstrate how the rick refactor fills that element:\n\n**模块边界** placeholder: 模块 = cli/handler/env/builder/runtime; 四层架构; 逐级往下调用\n\n**职责** placeholder: env 四职责; runtime 职责（拉起 pi + 校验 session 就绪 + 返回 (sessionID, trace)）; handler 职责（编排 + 持久化 sessionID）\n\n**接口契约** placeholder: runtime 返回 (sessionID, trace); handler 编排 env→builder→runtime\n\n**验收标准** placeholder: 功能等价 = 通过所有功能验收; dag/门禁下沉; dry-run/go test/集成测试\n\nThis \"承载\"s the conclusions well.\n\nNow, I need to be very careful about the `{{` check. I will not use `{{...}}` anywhere. For placeholders I'll use `〈模块名〉` or `【...】` or `<模块名>`.\n\nLet me also make sure I don't accidentally write `{{` in the content. I'll use `<...>` for placeholders.\n\nNow let me also write the README.md update. Current README.md index table:\n\n```\n| 文件 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| `architecture.md` | ... |\n| `commands.md` | ... |\n| `go-patterns.md` | ... |\n| `testing-conventions.md` | ... |\n| `project-conventions.md` | ... |\n```\n\nI need to add a `spec.md` row. I'll place it first (since it's the信息内核, most fundamental). Actually, let me add it as the first row or after project-conventions. The order should reflect importance. I'll add it as the first data row since spec is the信息内核.\n\nAlso, I noticed the README doesn't currently list `env.md`, `pi-runtime.md`, and `bugs.md` which exist in the domain directory. Wait, let me check: the ls showed:\n- architecture.md\n- bugs.md\n- commands.md\n- env.md\n- go-patterns.md\n- pi-runtime.md\n- project-conventions.md\n- README.md\n- testing-conventions.md\n\nBut README.md index only lists: architecture.md, commands.md, go-patterns.md, testing-conventions.md, project-conventions.md.\n\nSo env.md, pi-runtime.md, bugs.md are NOT in the index. But my task only requires adding spec.md. I should not over-reach. But wait — should I also add env.md, pi-runtime.md, bugs.md? The task says \"更新 .rick/domain/README.md 索引表，登记 spec.md 一行\". So just add spec.md. I'll keep it minimal and